      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "As-cast HfMoTaTiZr has a yield strength of approximately 855 MPa near 1000 °C.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thirty to fifty percent of the Ta content will be replaced by V.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "V is lighter than Ta.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Replacing Ta with V will reduce the overall density of HfMoTaTiZr.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The V-substituted alloy will retain a homogeneous BCC solid-solution phase.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8746096::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC9586648::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The retained BCC solid solution will exhibit lattice-distortion and solid-solution strengthening.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9586648::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding V will maintain dislocation-pinning effects needed for high yield strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The V-substituted alloy will preserve approximately 1600 MPa yield strength at room temperature.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The V-substituted alloy will retain at least 850 MPa yield strength at 1000 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The V-substituted alloy will have a density below approximately 10 g/cm³.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical performance will be evaluated at room temperature and approximately 1000 °C under tensile and/or compressive loading.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The comparison will be restricted to identically processed as-cast baseline and V-substituted alloys.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.design",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis will be rejected if density is not reduced by at least 5% relative to the baseline.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.falsification_rule",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis will be rejected if yield strength decreases by more than 10% at either room temperature or 1000 °C.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.falsification_rule",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimal Ta-replacement fraction and the effects on ductility and fracture toughness are uncertain.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": false,
